      "writtenOn": "2025-09-26T18:42:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For RTK platforms we set then when sending SET_PDOs. Check the configs, it should be based on a config called ONFIG_PDC_POWER_MGMT_SRC_PDO_PEAK_OCP_*\n\nSee https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/subsys/pd_controller/pdc_power_mgmt.c;drc\u003dde7f1e1c5afcc05970ab6d9b6ba0aac16e6e1764;l\u003d880",
      "parentUuid": "f06e09e7_8e96a619",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 124,
