      "writtenOn": "2025-09-29T13:59:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Vendor Info File Definition\nVersion 3.36\n\nSrc_PDO_Peak_Current\nPeak current (that is, over the value specified by Src_PDO_Voltage) that the Qualifying\nProduct may provide for short periods.\nValid options are:\n0 – 100% IOC\n1 – 130% IOC\n2 – 150% IOC\n3 – 200% IOC\n\nI am not sure how this is translated from PD spec to VIF definitions",
